{"version":1,"key":"quest:141","content":{"id":141,"title":"cross-fade 是什么？一般用于何处？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:141","type":"quest","id":141},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"CSS cross-fade() 混合图像与过渡用法","meta":"","excerpt":"当需要在 CSS 中将多张背景图按比例混合叠加，或者实现图片之间的平滑过渡动画时，cross-fade() 函数可以派上用场。它将两张或多张图像按照指定的透明度比例融合在一起，生成一张新的合成图像，结果是一个 <image> 类型的值，因此可以用在任何接受图像的属性上（background-image、list-sty","target":{"key":"card:736","type":"card","id":736},"citeKey":"card:736"}],"trail":[{"time":1769431055247,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1779408323671,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1779410749935,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1769431055247,"updateTime":1769431055247,"resolvedTime":1779410749935},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1769431055247}}